cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its physics write-up, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Black Hole Web: Interstellar Style"
abstract: >-
  Gargantua from Interstellar, ray-traced through Kerr spacetime in the browser.
  Per-pixel Kerr null geodesics (RK4 in Mino time), a Novikov-Thorne blackbody
  accretion disk with exact Doppler and gravitational redshift, and a
  step-by-step derivation of every equation with 27 verified references.
authors:
  - alias: Happyuky7
    website: "https://happyuky7.com/"
